      "description": "These panels read Fly's hosted Prometheus (datasource `fly`). They need `FLY_ORG` (the org slug) and `FLY_PROM_TOKEN` (a read-only token from `fly tokens create readonly`) in `.env`, then `make up`. Until both are set, every panel in this row shows a datasource error (401): that is missing configuration, not an outage. The laptop probes above (fly-network, fly-portal) do not depend on it.",
